  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Daube is how Provence does Sunday cooking. Beef shin goes into a pot with red wine, olives, and a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "bouquet garni ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "bouquet-garni"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", then you "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "braise",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "braise"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " it low and slow for hours until the meat falls apart and the sauce turns dark and rich."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Make this a day ahead if you can. The flavour deepens overnight and the fat is easy to skim when cold."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
